1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,460
我们回来了
We're back!

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:03,520
发生了件超搞笑的事
Funniest thing --

3
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,540
斯黛拉散步时爱上了一只狗狗
Stella fell in love with this dog on our walk,

4
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,420
她就这么含情脉脉地凝望着
just stared at it lovingly.

5
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,900
结果发现那是她在轮毂罩映出的像
Turned out to be her reflection in a hubcap.

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,040
搞得人哭笑不得
Can you blame her?

7
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,800
话说我历史考试拿了个A
I got an "A" on my history exam, by the way.

8
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,080
你当真要和狗狗争宠吗
Really, you're competing with the dog?

9
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,778
别理他 乖孩子
Don't let it bother you, girl.

10
00:00:15,778 --> 00:00:17,228
杰 咱们得谈谈
Jay, we need to talk.

11
00:00:17,503 --> 00:00:18,900
我今天到过敏症医生那去了
I went to an allergist today,

12
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,140
他认为乔身上的疹子是过敏引起的
and he thinks that Joe's rash is an allergy.

13
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,640
真厉害 过敏症医生发现过敏症状了
What a surprise -- an allergist found an allergy.

14
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:26,120
他认为乔可能对斯黛拉过敏
He thinks he might be allergic to Stella.

15
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:26,540
什么
What?

16
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,220
这只狗带来的唯一反应就是引人发笑
The only reaction this dog gives people is the giggles.

17
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,280
当她想舔自己脸的时候...
I mean, when she tried to lick her own face...

18
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,700
在我们村 如果一只山羊有那么笨
In my village, if a goat acted that dumb,

19
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,000
我们都不会吃它
we wouldn't even eat it.

20
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,820
过敏这事不是开玩笑
This allergy thing is very serious.

21
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,820
我们得把他俩分开一星期
We need to separate them for a week

22
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,500
看看疹子会不会消褪
to see if the rash goes away.

23
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,279
那么久看不到乔我可能会受不了
I don't know if I can go that long without seeing Joe.

24
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:45,473
不是乔要走 是狗要走
Not joe! The dog!

25
00:00:45,473 --> 00:00:46,800
我已经给米奇和卡梅隆打过电话了
I already called Mitch and Cameron.

26
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,480
他们可以照顾她
They're gonna take her.

27
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,200
走一星期吗
For a week?!

28
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,380
她会心灵受伤 她可是很敏感的
She'll be traumatized! She's very sensitive!

29
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,580
她是只会在车道上蹭屁股的狗
She scrapes her butt on the driveway.

30
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,620
你怎么就这么不待见她
Why don't you like her?

31
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,978
她跟你什么仇什么怨
She's never done anything to you.

32
00:00:54,978 --> 00:00:57,684
你自己瞧 我的面霜
Ay, look! My face cream!

33
00:00:59,131 --> 00:01:01,400
你知道这东西多少钱吗
Do you know how much this costs?

34
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,220
不知道 多少钱啊
No. How much?

35
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,260
别转移话题
Don't change the subject!

36
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,660
这狗现在就得走
The dog goes now!

37
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,360
这么一提我才发现
You know, now that I think about it,

38
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,580
我可能也对斯黛拉过敏
I could be allergic to Stella.

39
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,480
自从她来了我就有点呼吸困难[古板]
I've been a little stuffy since we got her.

40
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:12,780
斯黛拉没来前你就很古板
You were stuffy long before Stella.

41
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:14,820
你不记得那次你在芝士店批评服务员
Do you not remember scolding that waiter at Chuck E. Cheese

42
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:15,900
只是因为他是从右边上餐吗
for serving you from the right?

43
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,760
维多利亚式
Victorian.

44
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,140
现代
Modern.

45
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:32,640
纯木工
Craftsman.

46
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:33,920
西班牙式
Spanish.

47
00:01:34,898 --> 00:01:37,500
欧洲的 哥特式
European...Gothic?

48
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,280
安迪 这是《冰雪奇缘》里的城堡
Andy, it's the castle from "Frozen".

49
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,200
很抱歉 你没准备好
I'm sorry, but you're not ready.

50
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:42,820
什么
What?

51
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,160
听到"你准备好了"这个消息
To hear that you're ready!

52
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:47,100
恭喜你 助理
Congratulations, assistant!

53
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:48,980
我要引领你到另一个境界
I'm moving you up to the next level.

54
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:50,220
苍天啊
Holy cow.

55
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:52,820
刚才可把人紧张坏了
That was an emotional thrill ride.

56
00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:54,120
这个周日
This Sunday,

57
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:57,520
你要负责销售林登那里的科德角式房
you are manning the open house of the Cope Cod on Linden.

58
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:59,220
这意味着你负责在街边
That means you're gonna be sticking

59
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,660
安放好售房标志和气球
the sign and the balloons on the corner,

60
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:02,340
你负责把所有灯打开
you're gonna be turning on all the lights,

61
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,120
你负责烤好布朗尼蛋糕
you're gonna be baking all the brownies.

62
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,900
我会让您为我骄傲的 先生
I will make you proud, sir.

63
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:06,860
你还要负责干什么
What else are you gonna do?

64
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,380
我要确保客人登记好信息
I will make sure people sign in.

65
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,340
还有什么
What else?

66
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,880
我给客人展示主卧的时候
When I show someone the master bedroom,

67
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,880
我会说 "这是奇迹发生的地方"
I'll say, "This is where the magic happens."

68
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,074
-保准能卖掉 -太好了
- I'm sold! - Yes!

69
00:02:14,074 --> 00:02:16,360
小伙伴 我等下要去商场
Hey, buddy. I got to hit the mall a little later.

70
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,840
你想不想到按摩椅上去享受下
You wanna grab a couple of chair massages

71
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,760
直到他们赶我们走
till they kick us out?

72
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,880
不了 我要跟几个朋友出去玩
Nah. I'm gonna go hang out with some of my friends.

73
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:21,580
好吧
Okay.

74
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:23,460
玩得开心
Have fun.

75
00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:25,240
现在的青少年啊
Teenagers, huh?

76
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,120
是啊 越来越不想和我一起
Yeah, it's been happening more and more,

77
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,140
但这正常
but it's natural.

78
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,500
这个年龄的小孩需要空间
Kids that age want distance.

79
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,538
昨天他还紧紧抓着你的手
One day, they're holding your hand so tight it hurts.

80
00:02:31,538 --> 00:02:33,831
第二天他们就把你想吃的苹果给吃了
The next day, they're eating the apple you kind of wanted.

81
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:34,640
我可不会
Not me.

82
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:38,180
我从来不会拒绝和我爸一起玩
I never turned down an offer to hang with my dad.

83
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:41,300
他很走运 我开始叛逆之前他就去世了
Luckily for him, he died before my rebellious teenage years.

84
00:02:43,649 --> 00:02:45,760
肯定是外公和斯黛拉
That must be grandpa with Stella.

85
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:48,380
记住 莉莉 她只会在这呆一周
Remember, Lily, she's only gonna be here for a week,

86
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,460
她不会变成我们今后的宠物
She's not gonna be our permanent pet.

87
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:52,280
别跟我说 告诉拉里
Don't tell me, tell Larry.

88
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:53,700
他一整天都嫉妒得要死
He's been acting jealous all day.

89
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:55,920
你想太多了
You're being crazy!

90
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,155
老爸你好
Hey, Dad.

91
00:02:57,155 --> 00:03:00,540
杰 你好 瞧瞧我们的小稀客
Hey, Jay.There's our precious little houseguest.

92
00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:01,580
好了 听清楚
Okay, guys, listen up.

93
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,380
她每天要散三次步
She gets three walks a day.

94
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,140
别让她上床 我们在训练这个
Keep her off the bed. We're training her.

95
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,500
吃鸡不能带骨头 如果她开始喘气
No chicken bones. If she starts to wheeze --

96
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,180
记不记得那次你送我去夏令营
Remember when you dropped me off at summer camp?

97
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:10,500
你车都没停稳就把我撂了下来
You barely slowed down the car.

98
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:13,020
你又没有会让你难以呼吸的病症
You never had a condition that made it difficult to breathe.

99
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:15,007
我当时是运动夏令营里没出柜的同性恋
I was a closeted gay kid at sports camp.

100
00:03:15,007 --> 00:03:16,600
我一整周都迷迷糊糊的
I spent the week in mid-faint.

101
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:19,380
莉莉 别忘了多揉揉斯黛拉的小肚肚
Lily, don't forget to give Stella lots of belly rubs.

102
00:03:20,540 --> 00:03:21,699
爷爷 这件事
Grandpa, this is coming

103
00:03:21,699 --> 00:03:24,280
对我和拉里而言来的不是时候
at a really bad time for me and Larry.

104
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,881
好了 你别担心
Okay, well, now, don't you worry

105
00:03:26,881 --> 00:03:29,871
莉莉现在还不喜欢你这件事
about wily not woving you yet.

106
00:03:29,871 --> 00:03:32,310
你怎么这么可爱呢
Aw, who's the little weeble wobble?

107
00:03:32,890 --> 00:03:35,000
-我看不下去了 -老爸再见
- I can't watch this. Okay. - Bye, Dad.

108
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,560
我也不知道 平常要是没事
Oh, I don't know. I guess in my free time,

109
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,280
我喜欢关注有关再生能源的
I like to keep up with the latest discoveries

110
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,460
最新研究
in renewable energy.

111
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:43,660
记住 再过几个月
Just think, a few more months

112
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,500
你就再也不用经历这事了
and you'll never have to deal with this again.

113
00:03:45,980 --> 00:03:47,856
我不介意参加大学面试
You know, I don't mind college interviews.

114
00:03:47,856 --> 00:03:50,080
我其实挺喜欢和他们讨论一些
I actually like discussing the things that they --

115
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,540
我刚在跟镜子说话
I was talking to the mirror.

116
00:03:52,661 --> 00:03:55,280
我知道你想上的大学只需要你
I know all you had to do to get in your college

117
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,720
关注他们的Facebook就够了
was like their Facebook page,

118
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,080
但这可是普林斯顿大学
But this is Princeton.

119
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:00,680
我要向他们展现我缜密的思维
I have to show them that I'm a serious thinker,

120
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,640
你就不能支持我一下吗
and you could be a bit more supportive.

121
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:04,600
好吧 很抱歉
You're right. I'm sorry.

122
00:04:04,980 --> 00:04:06,380
你的衣服很棒
Your outfit's perfect.

123
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:07,620
谢谢
Thanks.

124
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,940
如果你是要申请伐木学校的话
If you're applying to lumberjack school.

125
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,380
而且主修的是在死后被自己的猫吃掉
And majoring in having your cats eat you when you die.

126
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,977
早上好啊
Well, hello.

127
00:04:18,977 --> 00:04:21,682
第一天感觉如何 回到衣柜...
How was your first day back in the closet...

128
00:04:21,882 --> 00:04:22,580
行业工作
business?

129
00:04:22,580 --> 00:04:24,380
你在说什么 我根本就没在这工作过
That doesn't make any sense. I've never worked here before.

130
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,780
那只是个基佬笑话 米奇尔
It's just a gay joke, Mitchell.

131
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:26,700
别想多了
Don't overthink it.

132
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:27,580
你还适应吗
You settling in?

133
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,740
是啊
Yeah. Yeah.

134
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:31,100
我是说 我穿着牛仔裤 在上班
I mean, you know, I'm in jeans and I'm at work --

135
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:31,900
感觉像是个技工
I feel like a mechanic.

136
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,440
我很期待
I am looking forward

137
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,150
来给我爸做几天自由法律工作
to doing a few days of freelance legal work for my dad

138
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:38,080
因为在我上班的公司
because, uh, where I work,

139
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,000
我有个不太公平的名声
I've gotten the unfair reputation

140
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:43,000
"办公室里的唠叨鬼" 这...
of being the office nag, which is...

141
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,980
那只是因为我跟一群懒汉一起工作
See, it's only because I work with a bunch of slobs.

142
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,440
我每天必须告诉那些人50次
I mean, I must tell these people 50 times a day --

143
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:50,760
擦干净微波炉 清洗咖啡壶
"Wipe down the microwave," "Clean the coffee pot,"

144
00:04:50,980 --> 00:04:52,640
这是谁的发霉的午餐肉啊 凯文
"Whose moldy lunch meat is this, Kevin?"

145
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,920
这回你请假的时候
So, did they put up much of a fight

146
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,440
他们有没有力争一番啊
when you asked for that time off, or...?

147
00:04:57,661 --> 00:05:00,440
这里真好 很随意
Yeah, it's so nice and casual here.

148
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,560
我等不及想展示我潇洒的一面了
I can't wait to get my chill on.

149
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:02,560
你在干什么
What are you doing?

150
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:03,960
什么啊 我就是这样
What? This is me.

151
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:05,060
才不是
No, it's not.

152
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,340
接下来的几天我就是这样
For the next few days it is.

153
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:07,560
我离开这里时
When I leave here,

154
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:10,260
男人会想成为我 女人会想跟我购物
men will want to be me, women will want to shop with me.

155
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,600
你想过
Have you ever thought of

156
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:14,040
在你的常规工作那边更友好一些吗
trying to be nicer at your regular job? Mm.

157
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,120
我也是慢慢学着
I mean, I've had to learn

158
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,220
如何在做朋友和做经理之间保持平衡
how to balance being a friend and a manager.

159
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,420
你可以称之为做"朋理"
You could call it being a "Franager."

160
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:20,800
但我没必要 对吧
But I don't have to, right?

161
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:21,500
有必要
Yes, you do.

162
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,220
我是你老板 你得听我的一切吩咐
I am your boss. You have to do everything I say.

163
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:25,260
好吧 露西来了
Okay, all right, here comes Lucy.

164
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,740
她是新来的 爸爸想让我跟她谈谈
She's new, and dad wants me to talk to her

165
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:28,640
她的穿衣打扮
about the way she dresses.

166
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,240
他说那令人分心
He says it's distracting.

167
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,040
学着点 露西就要被"朋理"了
Watch and learn. Lucy's about to get franaged.

168
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,540
真棒 还能当动词用呐
Oh, good, it's a verb, too.

169
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,498
好啊 露西
Hey, Luce.

170
00:05:35,498 --> 00:05:37,110
好啊 邓菲女士
Oh, hi, Ms. Dunphy.

171
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:40,040
不 拜托 我爸爸才是邓菲女士
Oh, no, come on. Please, my dad is Ms. Dunphy.

172
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,900
我只是克莱尔
I'm just Claire.

173
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:44,520
如果你想买一些上班时穿的衣服
So, listen, if you were looking for some clothes for work,

174
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:46,100
诺德斯特姆在搞大减价呢
Nordstrom's having a fabulous sale.

175
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:48,480
我在那里选了这件得体的小码衣服
I picked up this appropriate little number there.

176
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,680
我会去看看的
Well, I'll have to check that out.

177
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,740
-真棒 -谢谢
- Great. - Thanks.

178
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,020
看到我刚做的事了吗
See what I just did there?

179
00:05:53,641 --> 00:05:54,720
我得去工作了
I got to get back to work.

180
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,420
你一会儿想一起吃午餐吗
Do you want to have lunch later?

181
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:57,140
你不跟大伙儿去面食工厂吗
Aren't you going to the Pasta Factory with the gang?

182
00:05:57,340 --> 00:05:58,720
有谁要过生日吗
Oh, is it somebody's birthday?

183
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,351
我不知道
I-I don't know.

184
00:05:59,351 --> 00:06:00,991
他们每周一都去那里
Uh, something they do on Mondays.

185
00:06:00,991 --> 00:06:03,578
对哦 周一去面食工厂
Oh, right, yeah, yeah. Uh, P-Pasta Factory Monday.

186
00:06:03,578 --> 00:06:04,240
我知道
I knew that.

187
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,180
看起来你不知道
Doesn't seem like you did.

188
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,180
休息时间结束了 去完成工作
Break time's over. Get your work done.

189
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:09,880
看来某人的愤怒"朋理"有些问题啊
Looks like someone has an issue with anger franagement.

190
00:06:11,806 --> 00:06:13,484
开始扔吧
Let 'er rip!

191
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:15,720
真是一尊大炮
What a cannon!

192
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,220
-每小时58英里 -等等 什么
- 58 miles per hour. - Wait. What?!

193
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:19,980
是啊
Yes!

194
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:21,320
你们在干什么
What are you guys doing?

195
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,260
我们去超市时
When we were at the mall,

196
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:24,420
买了这个棒球 能显示扔得有多快
we got this baseball shows you how fast you throw it.

197
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:25,740
你们一起去逛了超市吗
You guys went to the mall together?

198
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,520
是啊
Yes, we sure did.

199
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:30,160
我们在西尔斯超市拿到了免费画像 以此证明
And we got the free portrait at Sears to prove it.

200
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:31,980
我们得扫描那幅画 免得它被毁了
We should scan that bad boy before it gets ruined.

201
00:06:32,403 --> 00:06:34,045
再见
Um...bye?

202
00:06:34,283 --> 00:06:36,111
你出局了
You're outta there!

203
00:06:38,259 --> 00:06:40,180
夫人 给你
Milady, for you.

204
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:41,520
发型看起来不错啊
Looking good there, haircut!

205
00:06:41,616 --> 00:06:44,660
他在这里啊 我的K歌小伙伴
Ah, there he is! There's my karaoke partner.

206
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:46,940
下次你唱埃博尼 我唱艾薇妮 好吗
Hey, listen, next time you're Ebony, I'm Ivory, all right?

207
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:48,960
工作了两天 还剩一天
Two days down, one to go,

208
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,580
办公室里的每个人依然爱这个全新的我
and everybody in the office still loves the new me.

209
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,119
咖啡过滤器脏了不要紧
Go ahead, leave a dirty coffee filter.

210
00:06:54,119 --> 00:06:55,664
歪着停车吧
Oh, park askew.

211
00:06:55,664 --> 00:06:57,600
随意的米奇尔不介意
Laid-back Mitchell doesn't mind.

212
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,960
当你所伪装的人
You know, it is really nice

213
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,200
受到大家的喜爱 这感觉真的很棒
to be liked for who you really are pretending to be.

214
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,398
好吧
All right.

215
00:07:02,398 --> 00:07:04,243
今晚在罗娜的派对上见 好吗
I'm gonna see you tonight at Ronna's party, right?

216
00:07:04,243 --> 00:07:05,525
好 什么派对
Okay. What party?

217
00:07:05,525 --> 00:07:08,580
这问题真是英语中最可怜的四个字
Aw, the two saddest words in the English language.

218
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:09,320
没什么大不了的
Nah, it's no big deal.

219
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,860
我们只是在下班后去酒吧
We're just stopping by a bar after work,

220
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,680
喝点啤酒 吃点辣翅
have some beer, some hot wings.

221
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,760
-瞧瞧我 -不 没事
- Look at me. - No, it's cool.

222
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:14,800
这是我的错
This is my fault.

223
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,020
我刚来这里上班时
When I first started here,

224
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,600
有人邀请我参加活动 我拒绝了
somebody asked me to do something and I said no,

225
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,340
现在他们觉得我不感兴趣
and now they think I'm not interested.

226
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:20,840
可能是因为这个吧
Yeah, that's probably it.

227
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,060
但是我也许会去参加这次活动
I might drop by this one, though.

228
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,800
我觉得大家会高兴的
I think people would appreciate it.

229
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:24,580
你不能去
No, you can't go.

230
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,528
什么 为什么
What? Why not?

231
00:07:25,528 --> 00:07:27,300
你知道你觉得
Well, you know how y-you think

232
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,980
你是他们的老板加朋友吧
that you're their boss and their friend?

233
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:30,560
你只是其中之一
You're one of those things.

234
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:31,740
天啊 他们讨厌我
Oh, my god. They hate me.

235
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:33,360
不 很多人喜欢你
No. Lots of people like you.

236
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:33,856
比如说谁
Like who?

237
00:07:33,856 --> 00:07:35,240
我 我喜欢
Uh, well, me. I do.

238
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,780
-还有呢 -还有...
- Yeah? - And, um, the, uh...

239
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,560
爸爸 爸爸可喜欢你了
Dad. Dad's a big fan.

240
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,358
我的小天使怎么样
How's my little angel?

241
00:07:39,358 --> 00:07:41,007
-今天不怎么样 -我在适应
- Not great today. - I'm settling in.

242
00:07:41,007 --> 00:07:42,928
不是你俩 是斯黛拉
Not you two -- Stella.

243
00:07:42,960 --> 00:07:43,900
她挺好
Oh, she's fine.

244
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:45,220
小卡在悉心地照顾她
Cam's taking great care of her.

245
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,200
有没有经常带她遛弯
Is she getting enough walks?

246
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,537
小卡中午回家吃午餐
Cam comes home from work at lunch,

247
00:07:47,537 --> 00:07:48,900
带她去狗狗公园
takes her right to the dog park.

248
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,000
实际上 他现在就和她在狗狗公园
In fact, he's there with her right now.

249
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:51,277
不要去巴林顿的那个
Not the one on Barrington.

250
00:07:51,277 --> 00:07:52,980
那里有只没阉过的松狮狗
'Cause there's an unsnipped chow

251
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:53,920
总是想搞她
always tries to hump her silly.

252
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,300
你好 普里契特先生
Oh, hi, Mr. Pritchett.

253
00:07:56,420 --> 00:07:56,800
你好 露西
Hey, Lucy.

254
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:57,880
露西喜欢你
Lucy likes you.

255
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,880
克莱尔 看看我的新衬衫
Hey, Claire, check out my new shirt.

256
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:00,980
我要谢谢你
I have you to thank.

257
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,380
我可没功劳
Oh, no, that's all you.

258
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:05,516
你应该跟她谈谈的
You were supposed to talk to her

259
00:08:05,516 --> 00:08:07,400
让她把那一对爆乳塞进衣服里
about storing those zeppelins in a hangar.

260
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:07,660
我说了
I did!

261
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,000
再说一遍 大声点 这里是办公场所
Well, do it again. Louder. This is a place of business.

262
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:12,220
她必须用布把她那俩球罩上
She needs to throw a tarp over those bounce houses.

263
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,580
爸爸 我觉得你才是无礼的那个人
Dad, I think you're the one who's being offensive.

264
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:15,780
这是我的公司 你搞定她
It's my company. Take care of it.

265
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:19,660
喂
Hello?

266
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:20,980
你在哪个狗公园
What dog park are you at?

267
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,520
你也下午好 杰
Good afternoon to you, too, Jay.

268
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,640
斯黛拉和我在牧场
Stella and I are at rancho.

269
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,438
谢天谢地
Thank god.

270
00:08:25,438 --> 00:08:27,480
你要小心好色的松狮狗
Keep your eye out for Randy Chows.

271
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,219
那个花样溜冰运动员吗
The figure skater?

272
00:08:28,219 --> 00:08:30,360
保证斯黛拉的安全就好了
Just keep Stella's safe.

273
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,630
杰 她很好 她玩得很开心
Jay, she's fine. She's having a great time.

274
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,020
等着 我给你发一张
H-here, I'm gonna send you

275
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:35,880
刚才我给她拍得滑稽照片
a hilarious picture I just took of her.

276
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,160
她从未这么开心过
She's never looked happier.

277
00:08:37,181 --> 00:08:38,956
大概只是对你表示礼貌
Probably just being polite.

278
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,939
你给我看的是什么
What the hell am I looking at?

279
00:08:42,939 --> 00:08:44,940
天呐 我给你发了什么
Oh, god, w-what -- what did I send you?

280
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,100
她脖子上是什么东西
What's that thing around her neck?

281
00:08:46,617 --> 00:08:48,440
那就是条新项圈
Uh, that is just a new collar.

282
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,920
她以前的项圈太旧了
Her old one was looking a little tattered.

283
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,780
你不许给她买礼物
Don't go buying her presents!

284
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:53,200
她现在还是我的狗
She's still my dog.

285
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,620
你只是帮我看狗的人
You're a glorified kennel.

286
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:57,460
那只是我用珠宝装饰的一个小项圈
It's just a fun little collar that I bejeweled.

287
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:59,220
下一步是什么 你要给她穿上网袜
What's next? You gonna dress her in fishnets,

288
00:08:59,380 --> 00:09:00,700
把她放到阿姆斯特丹的橱窗里吗
put her in a window in Amsterdam?

289
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:02,540
随意一点就好
Just keep it casual!

290
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:05,080
天呐 你真是个荡妇
Oh, my god. You're such a slut.

291
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,700
我爱死了
Oh, I love it.

292
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,540
没什么 我只是带我妹妹
Nothing, I'm just taking my sister

293
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:11,160
来咖啡店参加大学面试
to a college interview at a coffee shop.

294
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,660
我知道 不是吗
I know, right?

295
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:15,180
我差点忘了告诉你昨晚发生的事了
Oh, I totally forgot to tell you what happened last night.

296
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,200
丽莎 恩佐和我在回音公园的一个酒吧
Lisa, Enzo, and I were at a bar in Echo Park,

297
00:09:17,300 --> 00:09:18,540
然后恩佐说
and Enzo was like,

298
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,300
"我的梦想就是在道奇体育场跑垒"
"My dream is to run the bases at Dodger Stadium."

299
00:09:20,340 --> 00:09:22,160
于是我说"管他呢 我们这就去吧"
So I'm like, "Screw it, let's do it."

300
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:24,150
丽莎把头发卷到棒球帽里面
So, Lisa tucks her hair up to a baseball cap,

301
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:26,500
我们跟看场的人说她是贾斯汀·比伯
and we convince the grounds keeper that she's Justin Bieber

302
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:28,700
而那个贾斯汀会跟他合影
and that "Justin" will take a picture with him.

303
00:09:28,700 --> 00:09:29,740
居然成功了
And it worked!

304
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:32,400
不 你闭嘴 这还不是最精彩的部分
No, you shut up! That's not even the best part.

305
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:33,720
恩佐开始跑垒
Enzo starts running the bases,

306
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,880
他把衣服脱下来扔了出去
and he whips his shirt off.

307
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:37,098
衣服被丽莎接到了 然后她也脱了衣服
And Lisa gets caught up in it and takes off her shirt,

308
00:09:37,098 --> 00:09:38,198
然后看场人就说
And the grounds keeper's like,

309
00:09:38,198 --> 00:09:40,020
"你不是贾斯汀·比伯"
"Whoa, you're not Justin Bieber."

310
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,020
然后他就开始拿着靶子追我们
So he starts chasing us around with a rake.

311
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:43,660
我知道
I know!

312
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,500
等等 那是谁
Oh, wait. Who is that?

313
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:47,640
丹尼丝吗 让那个婊子来接电话
Denise? Put that dirty hooker on the phone.

314
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,080
姐妹 我告诉你昨晚发生的事情了吗
Hey, girl. Did I tell you what happened last night?

315
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,211
恩佐说他的梦想就是
So, Enzo said that his dream

316
00:09:52,211 --> 00:09:53,540
在道奇体育场跑垒
was to run the bases at Dodger Stadium,

317
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:55,600
-我说"管他呢 我们这就去吧" -老天呐
- and I was like, "Screw it, let's do it." - Oh, my god!

318
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,340
你的嘴就不能歇一会儿吗
Do you ever stop talking?!

319
00:09:57,340 --> 00:10:00,180
我坐在这里试图在精神上
I am sitting here trying to mentally prepare

320
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:03,140
为我一生中最重要的时刻做准备
for one of the most important moments of my life,

321
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:06,340
能不能麻烦你把嘴闭上
so can you please just shut up?

322
00:10:08,115 --> 00:10:10,193
我知道 不是吗
I know, right? Ohh.

323
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:13,900
好了 看起来他们要结束了
All right, looks like they're finishing up.

324
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,000
我现在应该进去了
I should probably go in now.

325
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:17,820
告诉她裙子很可爱 公主娜娜的秋装
Ooh, tell her cute dress -- Nanette Lepore, fall collection.

326
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:20,560
好极了 我就用"可爱的裙子"开场
Great. I'll open with, "Cute dress."

327
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:22,640
可爱的裙子
Cute dress.

328
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:26,560
安迪 离开放日还有36小时
Andy, 36 hours to the open house.

329
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:26,980
准备好了吗
You ready?

330
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,500
我生来就准备好了
I was born ready.

331
00:10:29,620 --> 00:10:30,640
事实上 那是假的
Actually, that's not true.

332
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,080
我早产了两个月
I was two months premature,

333
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,840
生下来才三斤重
weighed three and a half pounds.

334
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,160
我有点紧张
I'm a little nervous.

335
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,100
只有一个方法来解决...
There's only one way to get over that --

336
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,140
模拟开放日
Mock open house!

337
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:41,321
倒数计时 五 四...
Starting in five...four...

338
00:10:41,321 --> 00:10:42,477
忘了拿名片
Uh, business card!

339
00:10:49,420 --> 00:10:50,280
你不是安迪
You're not Andy.

340
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:51,757
抱歉让你失望了
Sorry to disappoint you.

341
00:10:51,757 --> 00:10:52,703
我在这
I'm here!

342
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:54,660
欢迎 快进来
Welcome. Come on in.

343
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,360
谢谢你
Thank you.

344
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,260
在干什么
What's happening?

345
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,520
我要带邓菲先生
I was about to give Mr. Dunphy here

346
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,940
参观这所漂亮的大房子
a tour of this beautiful open house.

347
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,980
我不认识邓菲先生 虽然听起来他很酷
I do not know who Mr. Dunphy is, although he sounds cool.

348
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:06,520
我只是从图森搬来的帅气的整形医生
I'm just a handsome plastic surgeon relocating from Tucson.

349
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:08,160
我是他的儿子
And I'm his son.

350
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,840
好主意 假装是我的儿子
Good idea. Pretend to be my son.

351
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,660
这就是厨房吗
So, is this the kitchen?

352
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:16,000
问得好 这就是厨房
Great question. Yes, it is.

353
00:11:16,180 --> 00:11:18,240
完全更新成为开放式厨房
Fully updated with an open floor plan,

354
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,714
大家庭的完美选择
perfect for large families.

355
00:11:19,714 --> 00:11:22,180
你和你的夫人还有别的孩子吗
Do you and the missus have other kids?

356
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:24,140
没有 就我一个 所以这有点太大了
Nope, just me, so it's way too big.

357
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:26,480
你看起来工作能力很差
You seem terrible at your job.

358
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:28,360
我不知道
I don't know.

359
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,360
你们看起来像是拥有很多朋友的家庭
You seem like a family with a lot of friends.

360
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:31,480
招待客人的话会很方便
It's great for entertaining.

361
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:33,560
这里的邻居多元化情况怎么样
How diverse is the neighborhood?

362
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,920
我这样问是因为
I only ask because I'm married

363
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,780
我娶了一位非洲裔的美人
to a beautiful African-American woman.

364
00:11:36,780 --> 00:11:37,640
不能告诉你她是谁
I can't say who,

365
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:39,460
不过你在《阿凡达》里见过她
but you may know her from "Avatar."

366
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:42,480
住在这一带的人
This neighborhood has a wonderful mix

367
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,560
来自不同的民族和种族
of different cultures and ethnicities.

368
00:11:44,900 --> 00:11:46,500
-听起来很危险 -卢克
- Ooh, sounds dangerous. - Luke...

369
00:11:46,700 --> 00:11:47,680
你们要知道的就是
Here's all you need to know --

370
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:50,260
在过去的两年里 这附近的房产价值
In the last two years, home values in this neighborhood

371
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:52,240
已经比城市平均值高了两倍
have increased by twice the city average.

372
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,040
这里很安静 也很安全
It's quiet. It's safe.

373
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:56,199
我想不到有什么地方比这里
I can't think of a better place

374
00:11:56,199 --> 00:11:58,380
更适合建立一个美丽的混血家庭
to raise a beautiful mixed-race family.

375
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:00,000
我要跟佐伊简单谈一下
I'm gonna have to have a quick conversation with Zoe,

376
00:12:00,060 --> 00:12:01,640
不过我想你已经卖出了这套房子
but I think you just sold a house.

377
00:12:01,820 --> 00:12:02,198
太好了
Yes!

378
00:12:02,198 --> 00:12:04,428
太好了 终于完了
Good. Is this finally done?

379
00:12:04,428 --> 00:12:06,511
爸爸 我想你和我是不是该
'Cause, dad, I was thinking maybe you and I

380
00:12:06,511 --> 00:12:09,013
穿上燕尾服去劳斯莱斯试驾
could put on tuxedos and test-drive Rolls-Royces.

381
00:12:09,013 --> 00:12:11,620
卢克 对不起 真希望我能去
Aw, Luke, I'm sorry. I wish I could,

382
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:13,860
不过我已经答应安迪教他怎么系领带了
but I already promised Andy I'd teach him how to tie a tie.

383
00:12:14,060 --> 00:12:15,560
来吧伙计 我有首系领带的小曲子教给你
Come on, buddy. I got a song and everything.

384
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,640
我必须要告诉你
I have to let you know,

385
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:18,960
我的脖子特别怕痒
my neck is extraordinarily ticklish.

386
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:19,940
是真的吗
You don't say.

387
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:20,860
你敢
Don't you dare.

388
00:12:20,902 --> 00:12:22,382
不要 不要
Don't. Don't!

389
00:12:22,382 --> 00:12:24,537
-快过来 -不 不要
- Get over here! - No! No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

390
00:12:24,676 --> 00:12:27,700
很高兴见到你 吉塔
It was so nice to meet you, Gita.

391
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:30,100
我会发给你我的大管独奏录音的
I'll be sure to send you that recording of my bassoon solo.

392
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:30,800
最好是
You'd better!

393
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:36,420
你能隔着电话杀了我吗
Could you kill me over the phone?

394
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:38,800
天呐 这些孩子全都一样
Oh, my God. These kids are all the same.

395
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:39,820
请告诉我
Please tell me

396
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,820
我们申请的时候没有这么无聊到爆
we weren't this aggressively boring when we applied.

397
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:45,260
都是辩论队 管弦乐队 预科 高绩点
It's all debate team, orchestra, A.P., GPA.

398
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:47,620
我真想一巴掌糊上她洋洋自得的脸
I wanted to smack one of them in her smug little face,

399
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:49,280
不过我觉得她就是个机器人
But I'm pretty sure she was a robot.

400
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:53,020
我真想见几个不这么无聊的人
I can't believe I'm missing spinning for this.

401
00:12:54,259 --> 00:12:56,289
你好 我是艾丽克斯·邓菲
Hi. I'm Alex Dunphy.

402
00:12:56,368 --> 00:12:57,080
我得挂了
I got to go.

403
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,380
太好了 请坐 我是瓦内萨
Oh, great. Have a seat. I'm Vanessa.

404
00:12:59,620 --> 00:13:00,660
想来点咖啡吗
Would you like some coffee?

405
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:03,600
不 谢谢 但关于咖啡有这么个故事
No, thanks, but I actually have a crazy fact about coffee --

406
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,660
蜜蜂喜欢咖啡因 因为花蜜里也有
bees love caffeine because it's found in nectar,

407
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:07,716
不过我对B的了解没那么多
but I don't know that much about B's,

408
00:13:07,716 --> 00:13:10,394
我的成绩单上大多是A
as you can see from my transcript.

409
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:15,620
你资料上说你是辩论队的
So, I see here that you're on the debate team

410
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,740
你还拉大提琴
and you play the cello.

411
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:20,060
是的 不过我的生活远不止这些
Yes, but I am so much more than that.

412
00:13:20,540 --> 00:13:21,800
我还是法语俱乐部的
I'm also a part of the French club.

413
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:22,840
跟我说说
Tell me more.

414
00:13:25,340 --> 00:13:27,320
很抱歉浪费了你的时间
I'm so sorry for wasting your time.

415
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,160
我犯了个大错
This was a big mistake.

416
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:31,000
我也许不是上普林斯顿的料
I'm probably not Princeton material anyways.

417
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:33,320
我昨晚大部分时间
I mean, I spent most of last night

418
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,460
都待在一部警察巡逻车后座
in the back of a squad car.

419
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,420
等等 什么
Wait, what?

420
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,120
疯狂的故事
Well, crazy story --

421
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,140
我朋友恩佐的梦想
My friend Enzo's dream

422
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:39,600
是在道奇体育场上跑垒
was to run the bases at Dodger stadium.

423
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:42,200
我说 "管他呢 我们这就去吧"
And I was just like, "Screw it, let's do it."

424
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,058
顺便说一句 裙子很好看
Oh, by the way, cute dress.

425
00:13:44,058 --> 00:13:45,240
是"公主娜娜"的吗
Is that a Nanette Lepore?

426
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,760
是的 眼光不错
Oh, my God, yes. Good eye.

427
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:48,540
然后呢
So, what happened next?

428
00:13:48,900 --> 00:13:49,720
然后我朋友丽莎
Well, then my friend Lisa

429
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,061
把头发塞进棒球帽
tucks her hair up into a baseball cap,

430
00:13:51,061 --> 00:13:54,080
跟看场的人说她是贾斯汀·比伯
and we convince the grounds keeper that she's Justin Bieber

431
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:56,780
而这个贾斯汀愿意跟他合个影
and that "Justin" will take a picture with him.

432
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:57,560
天呐
Oh, my God.

433
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,320
你真淘气 我喜欢
You're so naughty. I love it.

434
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:00,880
你知道的 贱人
You know it, slut.

435
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:04,180
天呐 真抱歉
Oh, my God. I am so sorry.

436
00:14:05,709 --> 00:14:09,720
晚餐你给我们做牛排吗 太棒了
Aww, you're cooking us a steak dinner -- how sweet.

437
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,780
是啊 我提前下班回来做我们的晚餐
Yeah, I came home from work early to cook us dinner.

438
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:12,680
你疯了吗
That's crazy.

439
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:13,700
这是给斯黛拉的
This is for Stella.

440
00:14:13,730 --> 00:14:15,000
杰
Ay, Jay...

441
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,820
你不知道我面临多强的竞争对手
You don't know what I'm competing with over there.

442
00:14:17,140 --> 00:14:18,520
卡梅隆帮她按摩肚皮
Cameron's wooing her with belly rubs,

443
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,040
买珠宝 亲嘴嘴
jewelry, kisses on the mouth.

444
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:22,380
我就想让她记得谁最爱她
I just want her to remember who loves her the most.

445
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:24,900
我不觉得斯黛拉会忘记
I don't think Stella is ever going to forget

446
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:26,180
你有多爱她
how much you love her,

447
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:27,600
不管她跟米奇和小卡
No matter how much time

448
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,440
还要一同度过多少时间
she needs to stay with Mitch and Cam.

449
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,300
你在说什么 她周五就回来
What are you talking about? She's coming home Friday.

450
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:32,480
是这样的
That's the thing.

451
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:33,300
看
Look.

452
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:35,448
疹子没了
The rash is gone.

453
00:14:35,448 --> 00:14:37,540
我们不能确定是不是因为斯黛拉
Well, we don't know that's Stella.

454
00:14:37,540 --> 00:14:38,980
很多原因都会造成疹子
A lot of things cause rashes.

455
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,620
说不定他只是没有上周那么大压力了
Maybe he's less stressed this week than last.

456
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:42,860
发生什么事了
What's going on?

457
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,620
我们得送走斯黛拉
We have to get rid of Stella.

458
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:47,000
等等 我们还没作出决定呢
Slow down. We haven't decided anything yet.

459
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:49,360
我们决定好了 这是对乔最好的
Yes, we have. It's what's best for Joe.

460
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:51,980
而且值得一提 我的眼睛也不痒了
And for whatever it's worth, my eyes have stopped itching,

461
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,719
我能尝出食物的味儿 也更有精神了
I can taste my food, and I have more energy.

462
00:14:53,719 --> 00:14:55,960
你昨天打了三个小时的盹
You took a three-hour nap yesterday.

463
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,240
我跑完马拉松太累了
I was tired from the marathon.

464
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,760
看《唐顿庄园》马拉松吗
The "Downton Abbey" Marathon?

465
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,140
那个家族太累人了
That family is exhausting.

466
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:01,119
我简直不敢相信
I can't believe this.

467
00:15:01,119 --> 00:15:02,870
杰 抱歉
Ah, Jay, I'm so sorry.

468
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:04,208
要不你养条鱼吧
Maybe you can get a fish!

469
00:15:04,208 --> 00:15:06,080
当然 因为开车时让你的宠物鱼
'cause it's so much cuter driving down the road

470
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,740
把头潇洒地伸出窗外要"酷"多了
with your fish's head sticking out the window.

471
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:08,700
鱼
Fish!

472
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:13,840
天呐
Oh, my God.

473
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,440
你要来再给我上一课吗
Are you here for another lecture?

474
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,400
你已经讲得够明白了
Because you made your point loud and clear.

475
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,580
我已经很随意了
I'm keeping it casual.

476
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:20,660
我今早都没正眼看过斯黛拉
I haven't even looked at Stella this morning.

477
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,500
好吧 别想太多
Okay, do not read too much into that --

478
00:15:24,580 --> 00:15:26,420
那是我从莉莉的泰迪熊身上脱下来的
I just took that off one of Lily's Teddy Bears.

479
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:26,800
没事
It's fine.

480
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,760
你们宠她我挺高兴的
I'm glad you guys are spoiling her,

481
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:30,220
因为我已经没法宠她了
because I won't be able to anymore.

482
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:31,920
乔对她过敏
Joe's allergic.

483
00:15:32,580 --> 00:15:33,020
不是吧
No.

484
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:36,360
而且既然她这么喜欢你们
Yeah, and I figured since she likes you so much,

485
00:15:36,740 --> 00:15:38,100
你们可以一直养着她
maybe you guys could keep her.

486
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:41,320
如果这样对所有人都好的话
Well, I mean, if that's what's best for everyone.

487
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,780
你要不要先跟米奇商量一下
Maybe you better check with Mitch first?

488
00:15:42,780 --> 00:15:43,520
他会同意的
He'll deal.

489
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,740
我给她做了块牛排
I made her a steak.

490
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:45,480
好吧
Okay.

491
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:46,860
这是她的沙发床
And this is her daybed.

492
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:49,621
我也许该道个别了
I guess I better say goodbye.

493
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,240
亲爱的
Hi, sweetie.

494
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,600
过来 我想跟你聊一下
Come here. I want to talk to you.

495
00:15:54,298 --> 00:15:55,327
好了 宝贝
Now, honey,

496
00:15:55,656 --> 00:15:57,702
你以后就要住在这里了
you're gonna live here from now on.

497
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,100
别这么看着我
Don't give me that look.

498
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:02,160
你什么都没做错
It wasn't anything you did.

499
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:05,080
你是世界上最好的狗狗
You've been the best dog I could ever have asked for,

500
00:16:05,260 --> 00:16:08,080
我非常爱你 所以
and I love you very much. So...

501
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,360
注意避开车子
stay away from cars...

502
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:13,260
不要吃锋利的东西
Don't eat anything pointy...

503
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,300
做个乖女孩
and be a good girl.

504
00:16:17,501 --> 00:16:19,305
再见 斯黛拉宝贝
Goodbye, Stella-bella.

505
00:16:25,038 --> 00:16:27,140
不敢相信我居然没哭出来
I didn't think I'd get through that without crying.

506
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:27,520
我也是
Me neither.

507
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,980
老爸 来看这个视频
Hey, dad, check out this video.

508
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:34,540
一头茶杯猪在弹钢琴
It's a teacup pig playing a piano.

509
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:37,100
我看过了 安迪给我发的
I saw that. Andy sent it to me.

510
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:37,980
不可思议
Unbelievable.

511
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:38,860
我开始也这么想
That's what I thought,

512
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,000
不过我们后来做了调查
but then Andy and I did some digging.

513
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,660
原来猪超有音乐天赋
It turns out pigs are crazy musical.

514
00:16:41,766 --> 00:16:43,385
又是安迪
Good ol' Andy.

515
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:45,580
有什么问题吗
Is something up, buddy?

516
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:48,700
我就拒绝了你一次
I said "no" one time.

517
00:16:48,740 --> 00:16:51,220
结果现在你说的都是安迪怎么怎么样
And suddenly it's all "Andy this" and "Andy that."

518
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,780
我没别的意思
Well, I didn't mean anything by it.

519
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:54,380
你看上去需要一点个人空间
It just seemed like you needed some space,

520
00:16:54,380 --> 00:16:55,340
所以我给你空间
so I gave it to you.

521
00:16:55,340 --> 00:16:56,060
我懂的
I get it.

522
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:57,680
你到了想独立自主的年纪
You're at that age when you want to separate.

523
00:16:57,960 --> 00:17:00,440
是我从你那独立出来
Yeah, I separate from you,

524
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:01,840
而不是反过来
not the other way around.

525
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,520
也许我不想老跟着你做一些傻事
Maybe I don't want to do dumb stuff with you all the time,

526
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:07,300
可是
but

527
00:17:07,300 --> 00:17:10,500
这不代表你能找人取代我
that doesn't mean you get to replace me.

528
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:11,540
什么
What?

529
00:17:13,060 --> 00:17:15,580
你开玩笑吗 我永远不可能找人取代你
Are you kidding me? I could never replace you.

530
00:17:15,620 --> 00:17:17,580
如果我来决定 我们会一起做所有的事
If it were up to me, we'd do everything together.

531
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:18,220
真的吗
Really?

532
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:20,118
我会跟你一起读大学
Yeah, I'd go to college with you.

533
00:17:20,118 --> 00:17:22,560
我们可以当室友 一起进兄弟会
We’d-we'd be roommates. We'd try to join a frat.

534
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:23,380
没有一个兄弟会愿意要我们
None of them would take us.

535
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,140
我们自己办一个
We'd start our own.

536
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,500
天呐 听起来太棒了
Oh, my God. That sounds amazing.

537
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:26,840
为什么没人要我们
Why wouldn't they take us?

538
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:28,500
他们肯定会要我 但我会说
Well, yeah, they'd take me, but I'd be like,

539
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:29,380
想都别想 布拉德利
"No way, Bradley,

540
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,720
没有我的小伙伴我是不会来的
not without my little pal, here."

541
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,534
关于这个 我心情有点复杂
I have mixed feelings about that, dad.

542
00:17:32,534 --> 00:17:34,933
你对一个拥抱也会心情复杂吗
Do you have mixed feelings about a hug?

543
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:35,600
会
Yes.

544
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:38,720
我需要个拥抱 那我去拥抱安迪了
Well, I need one, so I guess I'm gonna go hug Andy.

545
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:39,980
好吧
Fine.

546
00:17:46,105 --> 00:17:47,800
朱迪 那封邮件太好笑了
Hey, Judy, that was a hilarious e-mail.

547
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:48,880
酸黄瓜比男人更好用
Pickles are better than men.

548
00:17:49,183 --> 00:17:51,020
你懂吗 太好笑了
Did you get that? It was so--

549
00:17:51,020 --> 00:17:52,680
你来这之后有干活吗
Have you done any work since you came here?

550
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,860
我在调动工作气氛
I'm working the room.

551
00:17:54,180 --> 00:17:55,240
看 运动装帅哥
There he is. Sport coat.

552
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:56,860
运动装
Sport coat?

553
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,858
真不敢相信 这些白痴居然觉得你幽默
I can't believe these idiots think you're funny.

554
00:17:59,858 --> 00:18:02,200
说起来 我有个理论
Okay. You know, I have a theory

555
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,880
是关于为何这里的人不喜欢你
why people here don't like you.

556
00:18:03,893 --> 00:18:05,220
我知道他们为何不喜欢我
I know why they don't like me.

557
00:18:05,220 --> 00:18:07,000
因为老爸把得罪人的活都扔给我了
It's cause dad makes me do all his dirty work.

558
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:09,840
看看我今天要训斥多少人
Look at this list of people I'm supposed to reprimand today.

559
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:10,595
来看看
Let's see here.

560
00:18:10,595 --> 00:18:13,648
他确实是对的 格伦有体臭
Well, he does have a point, Glen does smell.

561
00:18:13,648 --> 00:18:15,333
我要先从露西开始
I'm gonna start with Lucy.

562
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:18,215
露西 唯一喜欢我的人
Lucy, the last person who likes me.

563
00:18:18,215 --> 00:18:19,839
没关系的
Oh, it's okay.

564
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:21,620
露西
Hey, Luce.

565
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:24,160
克莱尔 我给你留了你喜欢的饼干
Hey, Claire. I got you one of those cookies that you like.

566
00:18:24,220 --> 00:18:25,800
别让我更加不忍心开口
Oh, don't make this harder than it has to be.

567
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,285
-出什么事了吗 -的确有事
- Is there something wrong? - Yes.

568
00:18:27,285 --> 00:18:29,880
开口说这个很难 不过
It's not easy for me to discuss, but--

569
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,660
克莱尔 我来吧
Claire, I got this.

570
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,840
毕竟是我的投诉 我来
It's my complaint. I got it.

571
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:34,820
露西
Lucy...

572
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:38,300
你是在上班 所以请穿得像上班
you're at work, so please dress like it.

573
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:41,020
你穿的这些上衣完全不得体
These "Tops" that you wear are completely inappropriate.

574
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:43,620
抱歉冒犯到你了
Sorry to offend you.

575
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:44,540
你知道吗
You know what?

576
00:18:44,831 --> 00:18:48,335
反正都要说的 格伦 你得勤洗澡
While I'm at it, Glen, shower more often.

577
00:18:48,335 --> 00:18:50,098
查克 别再随便用"回复给所有人"
Chuck, stop using "Reply all."

578
00:18:50,098 --> 00:18:51,461
还有多莉丝 没人在乎
A-and, Doris, no one cares

579
00:18:51,461 --> 00:18:53,040
你昨晚都梦到了什么
about what you dreamt about last night.

580
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:55,340
大家都记住了 这里是工作场所
Let's keep in mind this is a place of business, folks,

581
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:55,800
明白了吗
all right?

582
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:57,800
感觉真好
This feels good.

583
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:59,700
有没有人叫卡尔
Is there a Carl?!

584
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:02,319
律师啊
Lawyers.

585
00:19:02,319 --> 00:19:04,227
我说得没错吧 运动装
Am I right, sport coat?

586
00:19:04,307 --> 00:19:05,627
那不是他
That's not sport coat.

587
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,860
我回家了
I'm home.

588
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:13,880
你感觉怎么样
Oh, hi. How are you feeling?

589
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:14,940
我会没事的
I'll be fine.

590
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,000
杰 我真为你骄傲
Oh, Jay, I'm so proud of you.

591
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:18,460
今天你做出了牺牲
You made a sacrifice today.

592
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:19,920
为了自己的儿子 你做了正确的选择
You did the right thing for your son.

593
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:20,960
看他有多开心
Look how happy he is.

594
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:21,560
可能吧
I guess.

595
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:22,780
等等
Wait a minute.

596
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:24,680
-他脖子上是什么 -什么
- What's that on his neck? - What?

597
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:27,121
他的皮疹又复发了
His rash came back.

598
00:19:27,121 --> 00:19:28,927
不
No.

599
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:32,680
你的手肯定沾到了斯黛拉的狗毛
You must have some Stella on you.

600
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,280
不 我之后直接去了俱乐部
No, no, I went to straight to the club after.

601
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:36,240
在那洗了个澡 哭了一下
Took a shower, maybe cried a little bit in there,

602
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:37,580
重新换了衣服
changed clothes to make sure.

603
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:38,680
何况我才刚回来呢
Plus, I just got here.

604
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,160
皮疹长出来的时间比这长
A rash would take longer to come out.

605
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:41,500
那是什么味道
What's that smell?

606
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:43,420
-什么味道 -闻起来像花
- What smell? - It smells like flowers or something.

607
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:44,600
我可没买花
I didn't get any flowers.

608
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:45,820
我闻到味道了 歌洛莉亚
I smell something, Gloria.

609
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:46,760
家里有什么东西不一样
What's new around here?

610
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:48,500
不一样的就是你觉得有东西不一样
The fact that you noticed something.

611
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:50,120
就是你
It's you.

612
00:19:50,823 --> 00:19:52,025
什么是新的 是什么呢
What's new? What?

613
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:53,060
香水 还是唇膏
Perfume, lipstick?

614
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:55,140
我闻到了薰衣草 还有
I'm getting lavender with,

615
00:19:55,140 --> 00:19:56,500
还有玫瑰果
I want to say rose hips.

616
00:19:57,140 --> 00:19:58,340
是你的面霜
It's your face cream!

617
00:19:58,660 --> 00:20:01,140
我今早是买了几瓶 不过
I did buy some more this morning, but--

618
00:20:01,140 --> 00:20:02,740
你买的是乔的皮疹消褪前
The same kind that Stella was eating

619
00:20:02,740 --> 00:20:03,860
斯黛拉吃的那种面霜吗
before Joe's rash cleared up?

620
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:05,946
现在你抹回了面霜 他的皮疹又回来了
And now you're wearing it again, and his rash is back?

621
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,980
不可能是我的面霜
No, it can't be my face cream!

622
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,920
不要让我跟心爱的面霜告别
Please don't make me say goodbye to my face cream!

623
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:13,020
斯黛拉吃面霜是为了救乔
Stella was eating it to save Joe!

624
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,498
但这还是不能解释
But that still doesn't explain

625
00:20:14,498 --> 00:20:16,180
为什么我感觉好多了
why I'm still feeling so much better.

626
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:17,100
我可以呼吸
I can breathe for th--

627
00:20:17,100 --> 00:20:18,340
斯黛拉要作为"狗雄"回家啦
Stella's coming home a hero!

628
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,760
莉莉 你能出来一下吗
Lily, can you come out here, please?

629
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:25,920
为什么要这么做
Why do we have to do this?

630
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,840
因为她们产生了感情 杰
Because she's become attached, Jay.

631
00:20:28,300 --> 00:20:29,960
她们现在都要一起睡觉
She's even sleeping with her now.

632
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,000
外公
Hi, grandpa.

633
00:20:32,180 --> 00:20:32,700
亲爱的
Hi, honey.

634
00:20:33,140 --> 00:20:34,320
莉莉 你记得我说过
Lily, do you remember how I said

635
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:36,740
斯黛拉从今以后要和我们住在一起吗
Stella was gonna be staying with us from now on?

636
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:38,920
事实上
Well, it turns out...

637
00:20:39,745 --> 00:20:41,100
她要和外公一起回去了
she's gonna go home with grandpa.

638
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:41,480
好吧
Okay.

639
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:44,320
莉莉 表达自己的感受很重要
Lily, it's important to express your feelings.

640
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,300
不要把它们藏在心里
Don't bottle them up.

641
00:20:45,940 --> 00:20:49,040
我睡觉终于不用听她打呼了
Okay. I can finally sleep without all of her snoring!

642
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,674
够了 把她给我
All right, enough. Hand her over.

643
00:20:51,109 --> 00:20:52,536
到这来 宝贝
Come here, baby.

644
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,460
那是什么
What is that?

645
00:20:56,060 --> 00:20:58,500
别笑我 我现在很脆弱
Please don't make fun of me. I'm very vulnerable right now.

646
00:20:58,620 --> 00:20:59,600
你能帮我弄一件吗
Can you get me one?
